WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:02.100
[Original ambient score]
A thin pendant emerges from the dark.

00:02.100 --> 00:05.200
Life moves.

00:06.100 --> 00:07.500
Introducing AURA.

00:07.500 --> 00:10.600
Keep what matters.
Wearable note-taking. Development concept.

00:11.000 --> 00:13.000
The thought. The moment.

00:13.000 --> 00:15.800
Press to capture.
Intended interaction.

00:16.200 --> 00:17.900
On your terms.

00:17.900 --> 00:21.000
Physical mic disconnect.
You decide when to capture.

00:21.450 --> 00:23.700
Considered. Inside and out.
[AURA opens into separate layers]

00:23.700 --> 00:26.200
[Circuit board and rechargeable cell revealed]
Exploded design study. Reference components shown.

00:26.200 --> 00:29.000
[The layers assemble into the pendant]

00:29.450 --> 00:31.600
More context. New possibilities.

00:31.600 --> 00:34.800
Capture offline. Organize with your phone.
[Illustrative interface]

00:36.550 --> 00:41.000
AURA. Capture the context of your life.
Capture starts with you.

00:41.000 --> 00:44.000
Development concept.
Features subject to engineering validation.
